    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by the fun that is experienced when playing with your friends. Blam! Blam! is a top down shooter that allows you to play with up to 11 friends. It is intended to be a lot of quick fun for when the inevitable 7 people jump into a voice chat and ask hey what are we playing tonight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to run into a match as equal teams or prove you're the best by taking them all on!<br><br>Pick whichever game mode sounds the most fun. (TDM, FFA, CTF, Domination, GunGame)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of our maps and battle till the last soldier standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Island</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/e5162522ad2c10836249bfa178de4ef1.avif?t=1749067193\" data-has-big width=800 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corridor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/37393a06030e39a877c7f87a698602c8.avif?t=1749067193\" data-has-big width=800 height=536 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/868aae5393f19c6435596707913c0104.avif?t=1749067193\" data-has-big width=800 height=558 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/cffa5e461142586f5c1111e238343a8f.avif?t=1749067193\" width=800 height=628 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the weapon that suits you best. Collect that same weapon multiple times in the match to power it up. Go for that good ole golden gun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/eb2a7c0f4a8dd888f6aad7201006b207.avif?t=1749067193\" width=722 height=114 /></span></p>",
