aragraph\" >Find the weapon that suits you best. Collect that same weapon multiple times in the match to power it up. Go for that good ole golden gun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149730/extras/eb2a7c0f4a8dd888f6aad7201006b207.avif?t=1749067193\" width=722 height=114 /></span></p>",
